# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Ω OMEGATRADE ULTRA — ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Copy this file to `.env.local` (or set the variables in your hosting
#  provider's dashboard) to override the built-in shared free keys.
#
#  IMPORTANT
#  • The app ships with bundled shared free keys and runs 100% keyless out of
#    the box — every variable below is OPTIONAL. Unset variables simply fall
#    back to the built-in key or to another free provider on the mesh.
#  • Never commit real keys. This file is safe to commit; your real
#    `.env.local` / `.env` files are gitignored.
#  • All keys are read at build time by Vite, so they MUST be prefixed with
#    `VITE_` to be inlined into the client bundle. Non-`VITE_` names are
#    ignored by the app.
#  • Personal keys beat shared keys. When your personal key is exhausted,
#    the app detects the 429/limit response, stops calling that provider,
#    and transparently falls back to another live source — it never shows
#    stale or fabricated data.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── TWELVEDATA (https://twelvedata.com) ───────────────────────────────────────
# The ONLY free source for REAL futures quotes/candles (ES, CL, NG, SI, …)
# and premium intraday stock history. Free plan: 8 REST credits/minute,
# 800 credits/day.
# Get a key: https://twelvedata.com/pricing (free tier, no card)
# Used by: futures quotes/candles, intraday history, forex, indices.
VITE_TWELVE_DATA_KEY=

# ── FINNHUB (https://finnhub.io) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Live US-equity quotes + the trade WebSocket (tick-by-tick), real company
# news with sentiment, and crypto. Free plan: 60 REST calls/minute,
# WebSocket included.
# Get a key: https://finnhub.io/register (free tier)
# Used by: stock tick stream, news + sentiment, quote mesh.
VITE_FINNHUB_KEY=

# ── POLYGON (https://polygon.io) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Daily + intraday candlestick history for stocks, indices and forex pairs,
# plus a second opinion for cross-validation. Free plan: 5 calls/minute.
# Get a key: https://polygon.io/dashboard/signup (free tier)
# Used by: intraday/daily history fallback, data-integrity cross-validation.
VITE_POLYGON_KEY=

# ── ALPHA VANTAGE (https://www.alphavantage.co) ───────────────────────────────
# Real-time FX rates and daily stock history. Free plan: 25 requests/day.
# Get a key: https://www.alphavantage.co/support/#api-key (free, instant)
# Used by: forex quotes fallback, daily history fallback.
VITE_ALPHA_VANTAGE_KEY=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  KEYLESS PROVIDERS (no key required — nothing to configure)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  The following free sources need NO key and are always part of the mesh:
#    Crypto   — Kraken, Coinbase, OKX, Bitstamp, BitMart, HTX, Binance
#               (data-api.binance.vision — CORS-enabled, geo-friendly),
#               CoinGecko, CoinPaprika, Gemini, Bitrue, Deribit, Bybit,
#               Bitget, MEXC, KuCoin, Gate.io, Poloniex
#    FX       — open.er-api.com, ECB/Frankfurter, Floatrates
#    Indices  — Yahoo Finance (^GSPC, ^IXIC, ^DJI, ^RUT, ^VIX real levels)
#    Futures  — Yahoo Finance (ES=F, CL=F, NG=F, SI=F, … real contracts)
#    News     — Hacker News (keyless fallback) alongside Finnhub
#
#  You can add your own free keys for ANY of the providers above later — the
#  mesh races every live source and the fastest valid quote wins.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
